In classic WoW, voidwalkers are often preferred over succubus for leveling and questing because they offer better **threat generation**, **health regeneration**, and **sacrifice** abilities, which are crucial for efficient combat and survival in early game. Succubus, while effective, lacks the same level of threat and durability, making voidwalkers more versatile and harder to kill in the early stages. [end of text]


